     "name": "unit 10",
     "number": 10,
     "folder": "Level 5/unit 10",
     "md": "Level 5/unit 10/unit 10.md",
     "mdText": "[HEADER] unit 10 — CD3\n\n[1] Conversation — track 8, 10, 11\nDavid is helping a stranger on the street.\nDavid: You look lost. Can I help you with something?\nWoman: Yes, thank you! **Do you know** if there's a drugstore around here?\nDavid: Yes, there's one right around the corner. It's called Smithee's.\nWoman: OK. And **do you know** if they accept traveler's checks?\nDavid: Um, yeah, I think so.\nWoman: Oh, great. Also, **do you know** what time they close?\nDavid: I'm not really sure. Listen, I've got to -\nWoman: Sorry, sorry, just one more quick question! **Do you know** where I can get a new map?\n\n[2] Speak Like a Native — track 9\n1. Can I help you with something?\nsmooth: “Can I”, “help you”\nweak: “with”\nCan I và help you đọc liền mạch như là một từ.\n\n2. And do you know if they accept traveler's checks?\nsmooth: “do you know”\nChữ “d” trong từ and nối với chữ “d” trong từ do, nên 1 trong 2 cái bị lược bỏ đi.\n\n3. I'm not really sure.\nsmooth: “I'm not”\nstrong: “not”\nI'm not đọc liền mạch như là một từ. Ngoài ra, nhấn mạnh vào từ not.\n\n[3] Study Notes\n\n[4] Grammar Focus\nCâu hỏi gián tiếp\nBạn có thể đặt một câu hỏi gián tiếp với cấu trúc “Do you know + if/whether/how/wh* + S + V?”\nA: [[Do you know]] if Brian has a girlfriend?\nB: Yeah, he does.\n\nA: [[Do you know]] whether or not the manager is coming back?\nB: Yes, I think she is.\n\nA: [[Do you know]] how much it costs to fly to Chicago?\nB: I'm not sure.\n\nA: [[Do you know]] what time the grocery store opens?\nB: Yes, it opens at 10 a.m.\n\n[5] Role Play — track 13\nA: You look lost. Can I help you with something?\nB: Yes, thank you! Do you know ________?\nA: Yes, there's one right around the corner. It's called Smithee's.\nB: OK. And do you know if they accept traveler's checks?\nA: Um, yeah, I think so.\nB: Oh, great. Also, do you know ________?\nA: I'm not really sure. Listen, I've got to -\nB: Sorry, sorry, just one more quick question! Do you know ________?\n\n[6] Substitution Drill — track 14\n1. Do you know __if there's a drugstore around here__?\na. if there's a souvenir shop around here\nb. whether there's a supermarket around here\nc. whether or not there's a bookstore around here\n\n2. Also, do you know __what time they close__?\na. which bus goes to the museum\nb. where the nearest bank is\nc. when they are open\n\n3. Do you know __where I can get a new map__?\na. where the bus stop is\nb. how long it takes to get to the airport\nc. how I can get downtown from here\n",
