     "md": "Level 8/unit 1/unit 1.md",
     "mdText": "[HEADER] unit 1 — CD1\n\n[1] Conversation — track 1, 3, 4\nAdrian is quitting his bank job to become a chef. His old friend Abigail has just heard the news.\nAbigail: So it's true? You're leaving the bank to train as a chef?\nAdrian: Yep. **If I'd gone** to culinary school after high school, **I'd be running** my own place by now.\nAbigail: Then again, **if you hadn't done** economics, **we wouldn't be** friends.\nAdrian: True. But **if I weren't** so cautious, **I'd have quit** years ago.\nAbigail: I'm a bit jealous, actually. I've always fancied being a vet.\nAdrian: Seriously? It's not too late to retrain, you know.\nAbigail: **If it weren't for** my mortgage, **I'd have done** it ages ago.\nAdrian: Hey, I have one too. Just promise me you'll think about it.\n\n[2] Speak Like a Native — track 2\n1. If I'd gone to culinary school after high school, I'd be running my own place by now.\nlinking: “If‿I'd”, “my‿own”\nweak: “to”\nstrong: “culinary school”, “own place”, “now”\nChia hai cụm ở dấu phẩy: lên giọng nhẹ ở “high school”, ngừng ngắn, rồi xuống giọng ở “now”. “If I'd” nối thành “i-phaiđ”; “my own” thành “mai-yôn”.\n\n2. But if I weren't so cautious, I'd have quit years ago.\nweak: “I'd have”\nlinking: “years‿ago”\nstrong: “cautious”, “quit”\n“I'd have” đọc lướt thành “ai-đơv”, nói nhanh chỉ còn “ai-đơ”. “cautious” đọc /ˈkɑːʃəs/ “ca-shợs” (giọng Anh: “co-shợs”). “years ago” nối thành “yiar-zơ-gô”.\n\n3. If it weren't for my mortgage, I'd have done it ages ago.\nlinking: “If‿it”, “ages‿ago”\nweak: “for”\nstrong: “mortgage”, “ages”\nChữ “t” trong “mortgage” câm: /ˈmɔːɡɪdʒ/ “mo-gịch” (giọng Anh không đọc /r/). “If it” nối thành “i-phít”; “ages ago” thành “ây-ji-zơ-gâu”.\n\n[MẸO PHÁT ÂM]\nCâu điều kiện dài: ngắt hơi sau vế “if”, lên giọng nhẹ ở chỗ ngắt, xuống giọng ở cuối câu.\n“I'd have” (would have) nói nhanh thành “ai-đơv” hoặc “ai-đơ”: I'd have quit → “ai-đơ quít”.\nGiọng Anh (Abigail) không đọc /r/ cuối âm tiết: weren't → “wơnt”, mortgage → “mo-gịch”.\nGiọng Mỹ (Adrian) đọc rõ /r/: weren't → “wơrnt”, years → “yiarz”.\n\n[3] Study Notes\n**I've always fancied being a vet.**\nMình vẫn luôn mơ được làm bác sĩ thú y.\n“fancy + V-ing” là cách nói của người Anh: thích, muốn làm gì. “vet” là cách gọi ngắn của “veterinarian”.\nCách nói tương đương: I've always wanted to be a vet.\n\n**It's not too late to retrain, you know.**\nHọc lại để chuyển nghề vẫn chưa muộn đâu.\n“retrain” là học, đào tạo lại cho một nghề mới. “you know” ở cuối câu làm lời khuyên nghe thân mật, nhẹ nhàng hơn.\nCách nói tương đương: You can still change careers.\n\n[4] Grammar Focus\nCâu điều kiện hỗn hợp: quá khứ → hiện tại\nGiả định quá khứ khác đi thì bây giờ đã khác: If + quá khứ hoàn thành, would + động từ nguyên mẫu. Hay đi với now, by now, still.\n[[If I'd taken]] that job, [[I'd be living]] in Tokyo now.\n[[If she hadn't missed]] the bus, [[she'd be]] here by now.\n[[If I hadn't learned]] English, [[I wouldn't have]] this job.\n\nCâu điều kiện hỗn hợp: hiện tại → quá khứ\nGiả định một đặc điểm hiện tại khác đi thì việc trong quá khứ đã khác: If + quá khứ đơn, would have + V3. Hay dùng khi nói về tính cách.\n[[If I were]] braver, [[I'd have asked]] her out.\n[[If he didn't speak]] French, [[he wouldn't have landed]] the job.\n[[If it weren't for]] you, [[I'd have given up]].\n\n[5] Role Play — track 6\nA: So it's true? You're leaving the bank to train as a chef?\nB: Yep. If I'd gone to culinary school after high school, I'd be running ________ by now.\nA: Then again, if you hadn't done economics, we wouldn't be friends.\nB: True. But if I weren't so ________, I'd have quit years ago.\nA: I'm a bit jealous, actually. I've always fancied being a vet.\nB: Seriously? It's not too late to retrain, you know.\nA: If it weren't for my mortgage, I'd have done it ages ago.\nB: Hey, I have one too. Just promise me you'll ________.\n\n[6] Substitution Drill — track 7\n1. I'd be running __my own place__ by now.\na. a food truck\nb. my own bakery\nc. a cooking school\n\n2. But if I weren't so __cautious__, I'd have quit years ago.\na. scared of change\nb. worried about money\nc. attached to my salary\n\n3. Just promise me you'll __think about it__.\na. sleep on it\nb. look into it\nc. at least try\n",
